  "description": "<h1 data-path-to-node=\"2\">Premium Black Woven Bamboo Storage Baskets – Modern Eco-Friendly Home Storage</h1>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3\"><b data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Item Code:</b> VH24027</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\"><b data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Category:</b> Eco-Friendly Home Decor / Storage Baskets &amp; Home Organization</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Origin:</b> Vietnam</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"7\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Overview</b></h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8\">Upgrade your home organization catalog with our handcrafted <b data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"60\">Black Woven Bamboo Storage Basket Set (Item Code: VH24015)</b>. Featuring fine vertical bamboo spokes coated in a sleek black finish, contrasted with natural rattan rims, this set offers a sophisticated modern aesthetic paired with traditional Vietnamese craftsmanship.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">Designed to serve as laundry hampers, waste baskets, plant holders, or general storage organizers, these eco-friendly baskets cater to modern minimalist, Nordic, and contemporary interior decor styles for residential and commercial spaces.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"11\"><b data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Key Features &amp; Product Highlights</b></h3>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sleek Modern Aesthetics:</b> The deep black bamboo body combined with warm natural rim accents provides a striking visual contrast that elevates any living room, bedroom, or bathroom space.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Lightweight Yet Durable:</b> Constructed from selected natural bamboo sticks, offering lightweight portability without sacrificing structural integrity and strength.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Breathable Open-Spoke Structure:</b> The vertical stick design ensures optimal airflow, making it an excellent choice for laundry bins, textile storage, or decorative plant covers.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sustainable Material:</b> Handcrafted from 100% fast-renewing natural bamboo, providing an ideal plastic-free alternative for eco-conscious retail markets.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"14\"><b data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Why Partner With Us? (OEM / ODM Wholesale Solutions)</b></h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\">As an experienced Vietnamese handicraft manufacturer and exporter, we specialize in delivering tailored production solutions to overseas importers, wholesalers, and retail brands.</p>\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"16\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Complete Customization (OEM &amp; ODM Services)</b></h4>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17\">We offer comprehensive customization capabilities to meet your specific brand guidelines and market trends:</p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"18\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Custom Dimensions &amp; Designs:</b> Available in varying sizes, cylindrical/tapered profiles, and nested set configurations to minimize shipping volume.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Color Variations:</b> Black, natural bamboo, whitewashed, dark brown, or customized color-matched finishes.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"18,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Rim &amp; Frame Options:</b> Custom binding materials (rattan, seagrass, or synthetic accents) to suit diverse price points.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"18,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Branding &amp; Packaging:</b> Custom logo tags, barcode labels, and eco-friendly retail packaging optimized for bulk container shipment.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"19\"><b data-path-to-node=\"19\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. Rigorous Quality Control</b></h4>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20\">Every unit undergoes comprehensive moisture testing, anti-mold/pest treatment, and strict structural inspection before packing to guarantee export-grade quality.</p>\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"21\"><b data-path-to-node=\"21\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">3. Guaranteed On-Time Delivery &amp; Capacity</b></h4>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22\">Backed by skilled craft networks and streamlined production lines, we guarantee stable output and strict adherence to agreed shipment schedules for large-volume orders.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"24\"><b data-path-to-node=\"24\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Product Specifications</b></h3>\n<table data-path-to-node=\"25\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Feature</strong></td>\n<td><strong>Details</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,1,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"25,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Product Name</b></span></td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,1,1,0\">Black Woven Bamboo Storage Baskets</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,2,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"25,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Material</b></span></td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,2,1,0\">Natural Bamboo &amp; Rattan Rim</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,3,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"25,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Technique</b></span></td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,3,1,0\">Handcrafted Vertical Bamboo Weaving</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,4,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"25,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Color</b></span></td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,4,1,0\">Matte Black with Natural Rim (Customizable)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,5,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"25,5,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Application</b></span></td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,5,1,0\">Laundry Hamper, Plant Holder, Waste Basket, Toy Storage</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,6,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"25,6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Customization</b></span></td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,6,1,0\">Size, Color, Shape, Brand Label, and Packaging</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,7,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"25,7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Supply Ability</b></span></td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,7,1,0\">Bulk production with strict export quality assurance</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"27\"><b data-path-to-node=\"27\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Expand Your Product Range with Authentic Vietnamese Crafts</b></h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"28\">Contact our sales team today to request samples, detailed catalogs, and factory-direct FOB pricing.</p>",
